  "version": "1.0.0",
  "kind": "standard",
  "organization": "ScaleDock",
  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the email list header fields of RFC 2369 (List-Help, List-Unsubscribe, List-Subscribe, List-Post, List-Owner, List-Archive), one-click unsubscribe from RFC 8058 (List-Unsubscribe-Post, the HTTPS POST, the DKIM requirement, no redirects and no cookies) and List-Id from RFC 2919, for both senders and receivers. It lists one version line, RFC 2369 with RFC 8058 (current); no legacy or preview line exists. Gmail and Yahoo bulk sender rules are included as labelled provider policy. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions and errata, the header fields, the one-click endpoint, and receiver behaviour.",
